WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.125 --> 00:00:07.916
"Sunny, no!" Daisy whispered. Then she shouted. "Stop!"

2
00:00:07.917 --> 00:00:12.754
"Oops!" Sunny stopped.

3
00:00:12.755 --> 00:00:18.249
Jan frowned. "Did Sunny just trot again?"

4
00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:23.079
"Er, yes, but it was my fault," Daisy said quickly.

5
00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:26.124
"I thought it would be okay."

6
00:00:26.125 --> 00:00:33.330
"Please be careful, Daisy," Jan said. "Horses are herd animals.

7
00:00:33.331 --> 00:00:37.879
If one horse does something, the others want to do it too.

8
00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:41.916
If Sunny goes faster, Blossom might go faster.

9
00:00:41.917 --> 00:00:45.207
And Grace isn't ready to trot yet."

10
00:00:45.208 --> 00:00:50.000
Daisy flushed. "Sorry, Jan. And sorry, Grace.

11
00:00:50.001 --> 00:00:56.064
I . . ." She opened her mouth, about to tell them the truth about her riding skills.

12
00:00:56.065 --> 00:00:58.916
But Jan suddenly nodded.

13
00:00:58.917 --> 00:01:02.207
"You and Sunny are doing well together.

14
00:01:02.208 --> 00:01:04.994
Why don't you ride him on the trail.

15
00:01:04.995 --> 00:01:07.416
I'm hoping it will impress Jon.

16
00:01:07.417 --> 00:01:11.457
I keep telling him Sunny only needs a little more training."

17
00:01:11.458 --> 00:01:14.957
"Sure," Daisy said.

18
00:01:14.958 --> 00:01:25.318
Jan saddled another horse, Ozzy, for herself.

19
00:01:25.319 --> 00:01:29.082
Then she led the way into the woods.

20
00:01:29.083 --> 00:01:32.212
The horses walked calmly along the trail.

21
00:01:32.213 --> 00:01:37.207
Birds and other wildlife peeked out as they passed.

22
00:01:37.208 --> 00:01:43.207
Daisy started to relax. "This is wonderful!" she thought.

23
00:01:43.208 --> 00:01:49.978
Soon they reached the edge of a meadow.

24
00:01:49.979 --> 00:01:53.168
Ozzy snorted and pranced.

25
00:01:53.169 --> 00:01:57.462
"What's he doing?" Grace asked nervously.

26
00:01:57.463 --> 00:02:01.041
"I often trot or canter here," Jan said.

27
00:02:01.042 --> 00:02:04.462
"So Ozzy expects to go faster.

28
00:02:04.463 --> 00:02:07.291
Sunny and Blossom might think that too.

29
00:02:07.292 --> 00:02:11.569
Use your aids to remind them we're only walking today."

30
00:02:11.570 --> 00:02:16.916
"Did you hear that, Sunny?" Daisy whispered. "We're only walking."

31
00:02:16.917 --> 00:02:26.665
"Walking is boring," Sunny grumbled.

32
00:02:26.666 --> 00:02:35.582
"I know. But remember? You're trying to be good, so you can stay on the farm," Daisy said.

33
00:02:35.583 --> 00:02:41.499
The horses were halfway across the meadow when the grass rustled.

34
00:02:41.500 --> 00:02:45.707
A fawn dashed past and ran into the woods.

35
00:02:45.708 --> 00:02:51.832
Sunny whinnied. "A deer! It's fast, but I'm faster!"

36
00:02:51.833 --> 00:02:53.541
He charged after it.

37
00:02:53.542 --> 00:02:59.624
"Sunny, stop!" Daisy pulled back on the reins. But it didn't help.

38
00:02:59.625 --> 00:03:03.082
"Daisy, stop him!" Jan said.

39
00:03:03.083 --> 00:03:11.041
"Whee! Cantering is fun!"

40
00:03:11.042 --> 00:03:15.041
Sunny dashed deeper into the woods.

41
00:03:15.042 --> 00:03:20.015
Daisy bounced up and down in the saddle. "Sunny! Slow down!"

42
00:03:20.016 --> 00:03:23.499
But Sunny didn't seem to hear her.

43
00:03:23.500 --> 00:03:33.749
He ran even faster. The trail was straight at first.

44
00:03:33.750 --> 00:03:36.624
Then they reached a sharp curve.

45
00:03:36.625 --> 00:03:40.649
"Ahh!" Daisy felt herself slipping off the saddle.

46
00:03:40.650 --> 00:03:42.791
She was going to fall!

47
00:03:42.792 --> 00:03:48.749
Abruptly, Sunny halted. "Whoa, Daisy! I felt you lose your balance."

48
00:03:48.750 --> 00:03:51.583
Daisy managed to pull herself upright.

49
00:03:51.584 --> 00:03:56.624
"Phew! I'm okay, but why did you have to run off like that?

50
00:03:56.625 --> 00:03:58.916
You were supposed to be walking!"

51
00:03:58.917 --> 00:04:01.082
Sunny dropped his head.

52
00:04:01.083 --> 00:04:06.447
"I saw the deer run, and I wanted to run too. I couldn't stop myself."

53
00:04:06.448 --> 00:04:09.125
"I know you didn't mean to, but . . ."

54
00:04:09.126 --> 00:04:14.957
Daisy looked around the dark woods. "But now we're lost!"

55
00:04:14.958 --> 00:04:18.499
"Don't worry, I know the way home," Sunny said.

56
00:04:18.500 --> 00:04:29.991
Daisy sighed. "I hope so. But just walk, okay?"

57
00:04:29.992 --> 00:04:38.207
When they arrived back at the farm, Jon was helping Grace dismount.

58
00:04:38.208 --> 00:04:43.343
Jan was riding Ozzy back toward the trail.

59
00:04:43.344 --> 00:04:47.957
"Daisy!" Jan cried.

60
00:04:47.958 --> 00:04:51.912
"I was just about to go back and search for you."

61
00:04:51.913 --> 00:04:58.061
Jon looked very upset. "I'm glad you're okay, Daisy, but this decides it.

62
00:04:58.062 --> 00:05:05.914
Sunny will go back to the dealer's farm—today."
